   city as an example, selecting water quality, water resources amount,
   density of population and national income as the evaluating elements, by
   useing fuzzy comprehensive evaluation method, the value of water
   resoueces of this city has been carded out. The results shows that water
   resources prices in this city is much higher than the present average
   water price. Therefore, it is necessary for the government to take
   mearsures to raise water use efficiency, strengthen environmemtal
