Abstract = {This paper prepared to investigate the current industry issues which are
   currently surrounding the application of current Malaysian Standard
   Method of Measurement (SMM) as a single standard system of measurement.
   An exploratory semi structured interview approach was conducted among
   the selected end-users. There are few important key points highlighted
   by the industry, which can be used as a guideline to be implemented in
   transforming the current Malaysian SMM. The outcome of this paper
   expected to be used as a supporting data to be carried along to the next
   level of the main research, which aims to develop a more accepted and
   practical SMM for construction works in Malaysia. (C) 2015 The Authors.
