   SMEs / Industrial RT towards the development of chips and corn waste
   products on the recapitulation are in both categories with a percentage
   value 80 percent. Based on calculations that have been done by using
   multiple linear regression analysis was obtained that perception or
   interest simultaneously significant effect on the increase in the
